Comprehensive list of common resources, how to acquire them, and how many of each resource you can acquire in a reasonable time frame of playing Azur Lane.

The tables on this page are generated from the [[Module:CommonResourceData|CommonResourceData module]]. Do not edit them by hand; update the module data instead.

== Notes ==

=== Glossary ===
Each location entry carries one of the following marks:
* <span style="color:#2e8b57">&#10003;</span> '''Green:''' Guaranteed drop from this source.
* <span style="color:#2e8b57">&#8277;</span> '''Green:''' Optimal farming location(s).
* <span style="color:#b8860b">&#10003;</span> '''Sand:''' Source spawning or item dropping is random.
* <span style="color:#b8860b">&#10007;</span> '''Sand:''' One-time drop only.
* <span style="color:#cd5c5c">&#10003;</span> '''Red:''' Not recommended to farm this resource from this source.
* <span style="color:#cd5c5c">&#10007;</span> '''Red:''' Cannot drop from this source.
The highest color is shown, when applicable.

=== Prerequisites ===
*This guide assumes you have [[Living_Area#Canteen_and_Merchant|Merchant]], [[Living_Area#Canteen_and_Merchant|Oil Canteen]], [[Living_Area#Lecture_Hall|Lecture Hall]], and all [[Daily Raid|Daily Raids]] to their maximum level.
*Quantities are only listed if the resource is in high-demand, guaranteed, and/or as the author deems fit.
**Quantities assume a player has not spent money and/or gems on these resources.
**Only '''guaranteed''' drops are considered. You can get a lot more of these resources than listed depending on your RNG in commissions, shop rotations, map drops, etc.
**Weeks are assumed to be 7 Days, Months are assumed to be 30 Days, and Months are assumed to be 4 Weeks long. This means quantities listed are slightly underestimated due to how the calendar works.
**'''Monthly''' and '''Bimonthly''' totals are calculated separately from each other. Bimonthly quantities are not used in Monthly calculations. Daily and Weekly quantities are based on Monthly.

== Terminology ==

=== Daily ===
*'''Academy:''' Anything related to [[Living_Area#Canteen_and_Merchant|Merchant]], [[Living_Area#Canteen_and_Merchant|Oil Canteen]], [[Living_Area#Lecture_Hall|Lecture Hall]], [[Commissions]], [[Guild]]s.
*'''Missions:''' [[Missions#Login_Rewards|Login Rewards]], [[Missions#Daily_Missions|Daily Missions]], [[Missions#Weekly_Missions|Weekly Missions]], [[Beginner Rewards]], [[Commander Handbook]], [[Missions#One-Time_Missions|One-Time Missions]] (not including Secretary Quests).
*'''Daily Raid:''' All stages listed [[Daily Raid|here]].
*'''Cruise Pass:''' Anything to do with the free [[Cruise Missions]].

=== Farming ===
*'''Campaign:''' Reward upon clearing a [[:Category:Campaign|Campaign]] stage (including Clearing Rewards).
*'''Hard Mode:''' Reward upon clearing a [[Combat#Hard_Mode|Hard Mode]] stage.
*'''Event:''' Reward upon clearing a [[Events|Limited Event]] or [[War Archives|War Archive]] stage (including Clearing Rewards).
**Event Point Milestone Rewards (for Major Events) are also included.
*'''OPSI:''' Reward from [[Operation Siren]].

=== Shops ===
This category does not include any gem spending.
*'''General Shop:''' Rewards from the [[Shops#General_Shop|Munitions Shop]].
*'''Core Data Shop:''' Rewards from the [[Shops#Core_Exchange|Core Data Shop]].
*'''Guild Shop:''' Rewards from the [[Guild_Shop|Guild Shop]].
*'''Merit Shop:''' Rewards from the [[Shops#Merit_Shop|Merit Shop]].
*'''Medal Shop:''' Rewards from the [[Shops#Medal_Shop|Medal Shop]].
*'''Prototype Shop:''' Rewards from the [[Shops#Prototype_Shop|Prototype Shop]].
*'''Event Shop:''' Rewards from the [[Shops#Event_Shop|Limited Event Shop]].
*'''META Shop:''' Rewards from the [[Shops#META_Shop|META Shop]].

